+
+	/* AirBridge32: as a slave, follow the sync master's sequence so the
+	 * daemon's per-slot channel switch actually covers the peer's slots.
+	 * Opt-in: without AWDL_FOLLOW_MASTER_SEQ the static "all master channel"
